Package: miadi-chronicle-server
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-node (>= 24.21.0-1), miadi-node (<< 25)
Recommends: miadi-config (>= 0.2.0)
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: The Miadi chronicle's host services: capture, hooks, plan insight
 The server half: what runs on the host where sessions happen and takes are
 recorded. Pinned npm releases, run by miadi-node:
  miadi-capture-service    @miadi/capture-service, and a per-user systemd
                           unit, miadi-capture-service.service, not started
  miadi-episode-capture    @miadi/episode-capture
  miadi-transcription      @miadi/transcription
  miadi-hooks              @miadi/hooks-core (agent hook events)
  miadi-hooks-interpret    @miadi/hooks-interpreter (reading a session)
  plan-insight-register    @miadi/plan-insight
 /usr/share/miadi-chronicle-server/SOURCE lists every version installed.
